# Keep the build context to code only. Data and outputs must never enter an image.
# Allow-list: ignore everything, then re-admit only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src
!configs

# Never admit caches, build output or data, even inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
**/*.zip
**/*.feather
**/*.h5
**/*.pkl
**/.env
**/.env.*
